:''For the enemies, see [[Saber (Enemy)]] or [[Saber Alter (Enemy)]]. Not to be confused with [[Saber the Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Saber''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 6.6 increases health, damage and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]].

