==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Saber CC''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Saber Alter CC''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Saber has high HP and very high DPS (especially against Floating) with [[Long Distance]]. This means that even though her standing range is low, she can actually hit enemies up to 475 range away, with a blindspot of only 150! Another thing to note is that she has 70 seconds cooldown, which ensures that in case Saber dies, there will be another one to replace it. She also has 5.5k DPS which is above average for general LD attacker and that is not even against Floating yet!

Saber is a rusher too, her fast speed allows her to enter enemy's blindspot and gives her usefulness against stages with enemies such as [[Henry]], [[Croakley]] or [[Tackey]].

Saber is an absolute powerhouse against Floatings as she can deal 20k DPS to them, combined with LD, she can destroy multiple melee floating enemies, such as majority of the Bun Bun family, [[Shy Boy]] or [[Brollow]]s.

==='''True Form'''===
Her True Form improves her health and attack by a lot, as well as her standing range getting increased to 350 from 325, making her now an even more powerful rusher and she will always get her job done. Another important thing to note is Saber's extremely cheap True Form cost, at only 3 [[Catfruit|Epic Catfruit]].

=== '''Talents''' ===
Saber's most notable Talents include '''Target Relic''' and '''[[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]]''', which immediately gives her a much-needed and valuable niche as a dedicated and disposable anti-Relic rusher whose lower recharge rate and longer range offers better sustainability compared to the likes of [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]] and [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]]. '''[[Wave Attack]]''' also works in her favor with her fast attack cycle despite its 20% maximum activation chance, extending her reach all the way up to 732.5 range against anything that isn't immune, while also covering her blindspot and dealing extra damage at close quarters. '''Attack Buff''' and '''HP Buff''' are always helpful on a nuker, provided if she has been boosted sufficiently with Catseyes.

==='''Orb'''===
Massive Damage against Floating/Relic or Strengthen are the best Talent Orbs for Saber Alter CC to gain the most value out of, as all three boost her damage and DPS substantially.

